Package: churncast
Title: ChurnCast Churn Model, R Track
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: person("AiCanCode", "Maintainers", email = "maintainers@aicancode.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Cleans the TiffinBox subscription exports, checks the shared data contract, builds point-in-time
    churn features and trains and evaluates the churn model with tidymodels (rsample, parsnip, workflows,
    yardstick), so its numbers can be compared with the Python and SQL tracks.
